tools.description:
Submit a Drive file search for async execution. Returns {job_id, status:"pending"};
poll gdrive_get_job_status until "ready", then fetch results with gdrive_get_job_result.
Use for long/large searches; gdrive_search stays for quick synchronous ones.

Submit a read-only query for async execution. Returns {job_id, status:"pending"};
poll snowflake_get_job_status until "ready", then fetch rows with snowflake_get_job_result.
Use for long/large queries; snowflake_execute_query stays for quick synchronous ones.
